<item><title>Ivory Coast beats Gambia 2-1 in CAN 2027 qualifier in Bouaké</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-beats-gambia-2-1-in-can-2027-qualifier-in-bouake-b7a422/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-beats-gambia-2-1-in-can-2027-qualifier-in-bouake-b7a422/</guid><category>Cote d&apos;Ivoire</category><description>The Elephants move level on six points with Gambia at the top of Group C, with a return leg set for Bakau on Tuesday, 17 November.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:11:53 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" length="32300" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
