<item><title>Abidjan hotel manager fined for illegal sewage link to storm drains</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/abidjan-hotel-manager-fined-for-illegal-sewage-link-to-91407e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/abidjan-hotel-manager-fined-for-illegal-sewage-link-to-91407e/</guid><category>Cote d&apos;Ivoire</category><description>The manager of Hotel Askala in Marcory Zone 4 was sanctioned for connecting the hotel&apos;s septic tank to public rainwater drains without authorisation.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:56:07 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" length="32300" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
